OL,3,AMan and woman die in police pursuit
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe occupants of the BMW, a 39-year-old
OL,7,Fman from Harrogate, two boys aged 16
OL,8,Fand 17 and a 16-year-old girl, have
OL,9,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of causing
OL,10,Fdeath by dangerous driving.
